<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7161" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπείθω</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Arc.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπ-</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			306.59
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>persuade, convince,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.2.52
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.84
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>persuade, move</i> to do a thing, c. acc. pers. et
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.124
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				156
			</span></i>, etc.; foll. by Conj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὡς
			χρή</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.123
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λόγῳ ὅκως</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				1.37
			</span></i>: c. dupl. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινά τι</span>
			<i>persuade</i> one <i>of</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				77
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.438
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>seduce, mislead,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.148
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				5.66
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χρήμασι, δώροις,</span>
			<i>bribe,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				622
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.5.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσίον διδοὺς ἀναπείσεις
			ὅπως</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				473
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMagd.</u>
				14.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				18.13
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπεπεισμένος</span>”
				<i>bribed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					101
				</span></i>
			.</div>
